### AtlasEcho Auth API Tests

### 1. Register new traveler
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Amelia Earhart",
  "email": "amelia@atlas.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 2. Login traveler
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "julian@atlas.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Get Current User (Replace TOKEN with actual JWT token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
x-user-id: 1

### 4. Update Passport Settings
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/auth/passport
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "Julian Echo",
  "bio": "Searching for the hidden melodies of forgotten places. Coffee enthusiast.",
  "distanceUnits": "Miles",
  "mapStyle": "Nostalgic Ink"
}
